free":false,"state":"locked","exercises":3,"learned":0,"courses":[],"closing":false},{"slug":"the-opposition","title":"The opposition","free":false,"state":"locked","exercises":2,"learned":0,"courses":[],"closing":false},{"slug":"promotion-tricks","title":"Promotion tricks","free":false,"state":"locked","exercises":4,"learned":0,"courses":[],"closing":false}]},{"slug":"next","title":"Put it all together","summary":"One complete game that uses everything in the course, then where to go from here.","free":false,"locked":true,"board":"1n1Rkb1r/p4ppp/4q3/4p1B1/4P3/8/PPP2PPP/2K5 b k - 1 17","exercises":1,"learned":0,"stages":[{"slug":"everything-in-one-game","title":"Everything in one game","free":false,"state":"locked","exercises":1,"learned":0,"courses":[],"closing":true}]}],"introduction":{"title":"A word before the first lesson","summary":"One minute, in the voice of the course: why games are lost under 1000, and how each lesson fixes it. Then your first stage, which is free.","segments":["Welcome to Reach 1000 Elo. This course was made for one kind of player. You know how the pieces move, you play games, and you keep losing them without quite knowing why.","Here is why. Under 1000, a game is almost never decided by deep strategy. It is decided by three things: a piece left where it can be taken for free, a king that stayed in the centre, and a checkmate that nobody saw coming.","That is what we are going to fix, in eleven modules. First the opening principles and the value of time. Then a tour of the openings you will really meet. Then counting material, tactics, and the checkmate patterns that finish a game. Then the habits of the middlegame, space, pawn structure, the endgames you must know, and one complete game that puts it all together.","You will not memorise anything. Each idea is shown once on the board, with the reason for every move. Then you solve new positions yourself, and the explanation comes after your move.","Your first stage is called Fight for the centre, and it is free. Start it when you are ready. A few minutes a day is enough. Let's begin."]},"narration":{"base":"https://audio.chessdesk.app/narration/reach-1000-elo","keys":["1ac44425","9699de7f","72591208","2323ac77","edfa70cb","9a20add1","67bac8ce","c68f4242","6fcfd704","514baa5f","4f06fc2c","c46b80b2","56281c02","87e92ea5","d1004a04","d7980b55","0ddf3ebb","d8b22f9a","2d31525f","9bd5534a","a7871c3e","322a2ad0","f609b104","ea782d09","83d2706c","57f99db5","3abf2509","f3c81d34","154f611c","dcbc96aa","9ee3ec57","50aa5637","864008f2","04de0996","63eb386b","71d6512c","5338a056","f5940768","3df19c15","c0ac09c0","be14b096","76eb4754","c6eb79e3","2c479e5b","3d7b26db","d500d358","f9abeec4","eeb459d1","33f96226","693e8d11","b261344f","eaeddc8d","cd2b989b","a84f9aa6","a993b952","71d5d5e6","ee6d2ccd","68899627","9f576dc1","d9a4602b","a74f5a60","ba92cee9","25ee900b","8982c79a","f5729c3b","74f66677","8e92b85f","2b3d5d3f","644bc85f","3e4cddd5","7a14eca8","112484f5","e4051972","a5c99c13","d95a6466","6cd45948","ba7184d6","1895ccf6","6d76cce5","b9527773","2e0fd1d9","101e7a6e","85a5d8d6","0bf46747","8557477a","3db54546","21d443bc","09630e68","ac94b121","d4e245e6","fb0f9a0c","779b6c5a","5c73415b","38df6ac4","95cc1f2c","30e5c126","d6d1c72b","71bc7e75","8f257156","596f2ab4","9c802e8d","8295b4c6","bb6fcb36","5055f2fc","cc2d7d6b","dbb42f6a","7313e771","49f22221","a9414698","23b1922c","dafa75e4","dd6b68a3","88271574","6bfc98c2","a6832e6f","d3de14cf","94c62d2e","64e3a55c","3bcaffb0","1128220c","b1d5237e","1fa1549e","22d9367f","a92c8263","65748f2e","9c6b5dd2","ba1bc5af","d2c29387","dee5c2f6","2ff2f12c","ca78410b","4a18b451","0ca05a89","ecee34f5","22eca1b3","002504dd","e572556a","9d93512b","2f316758","d39aebda","6229451e","980e7f26","212b086d","2800993e","12e39fb5","92d7e7f3","fa2bfee2","450d7300","3846cd2e","d570f2fb","144c0977","6ce68755","2e2b0a18","6848c1f7","5cdecaa7","4a98015f","d7a8d3c4","3057b9ca","8924d7ad","bbee73cc","886fea57","b6ea5729","9e576545","dc0e3593","d96e9cbc","